/target
# Tauri regenerates gen/schemas on build (capability JSON Schemas for IDE validation). gen/android
# (the customized Android Studio project) IS tracked — Tauri's default — so native customizations
# (FCM, Kotlin bridges, signing config) survive a fresh clone. In-tree ignores live in
# gen/android/.gitignore (build outputs + keystores/secrets).
/gen/schemas
# Renamed, versioned APKs produced by `make apk*` land in dist/<platform>/ (e.g. dist/android/).
# Raw gradle output lives under gen/android/app/build, ignored by gen/android/.gitignore.
/dist
# Firebase config — per-environment, downloaded from the Firebase console. Never committed.
# Defense in depth: gen/android/.gitignore also ignores **/google-services.json in-tree.
google-services.json

